  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.28",
    "summary": "During the resolution of attacks from any [PRECISION] weapons, the active player may, when Allocation Order (05.03) begins, choose an allocation group that contains a CHARACTER model visible to at least one attacking model, if the target unit has any. The chosen CHARACTER group then serves as the current allocation group until either those attacks are finished or that group is wiped out. When a [PRECISION] attack also carries [DEVASTATING WOUNDS], its mortal wounds go first to the CHARACTER group chosen for those attacks, provided that group is still alive.",
